{"id":"421832","name":"鸭蛋小青瓜年糕汤","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"","cover":"images/421832/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"年糕","amount":"160克"},{"name":"小青瓜","amount":"2根"},{"name":"鸭蛋","amount":"1只"}],"sub":[{"name":"酱油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：年糕（已切开）、小青瓜（已清洗）、鸭蛋。","img":"images/421832/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将鸭蛋打成蛋液。","img":"images/421832/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将清洗好的小青瓜放在案板上切成滚刀块，待用。","img":"images/421832/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"烧锅倒油烧热，下入蛋液摊成块，用铲子割开。","img":"images/421832/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"接着，合入年糕和切好的小青瓜，加适量的清水煮开。","img":"images/421832/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"然后，加适量的酱油。","img":"images/421832/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加适量的盐。","img":"images/421832/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加适量的味精。","img":"images/421832/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"调味翻匀即成。","img":"images/421832/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}